  "full_text": "So I'm probably not going to commit suicide. I can't imagine me doing that. Does that mean I have no honor? Maybe. Yeah, that's what that means. Like, I have no honor. I won't commit suicide. On the other hand, I could see myself starving to death. No. I won't stay in a situation, like if I have a job and it's like contrary to, I guess I have no honor or something like that. So like, if I got a job or something, you know, I got no dependents or something. Anyway, so like, is that what that means, no honor? I don't know. Anyway, so like. I guess I'm a soldier of Christ, right? What does that mean? Well, I saw a guy on the street that looked beyond hope. Maybe he didn't want to be resuscitated, you know? Didn't want to be resuscitated. He wanted to go down killed in action or something like that. So the fact that I didn't intervene shows that... That's how I analyzed it. Don't resuscitate. At that point, he wants to get killed in the street. So whatever. He was frozen and starving or something. Am I going to take a job that I... I know I can't stick with a lot of jobs. That's just a reality. So fuck it. I'm not sucking CIA cock getting... I'm not sucking CIA cock getting tortured. and it's that simple you know so uh uh so i get you know so there you go",
